        <activityName xml:lang="en">Municipal road, unbound foundation layer, recycling aggregate</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Municipal road, unbound foundation layer, recycling aggregate
Modern Swiss and European technologies are applied to regional storage facilities, material extraction, and production processes. 
UUID: 7a8c139b-e242-4190-91c6-a5879c07b58c
This dataset documents the production, installation, deconstruction and end-of-life treatment of 1 m2 unbound foundation layer for municipal road in Switzerland.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Layer thickness 800 mm, service life 80 years.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7a8c139b-e242-4190-91c6-a5879c07b58c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
